        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#091729;color:#eaf3ff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box\">\n<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 72% 50% at 48% 40%,rgba(20,63,100,.42),transparent 70%),linear-gradient(rgba(95,145,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(95,145,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:auto,4cqw 4cqw,4cqw 4cqw\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:.55cqw;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#22d3ee,#6475ff 55%,#d7a66b)\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:3.7cqw;top:3.2cqw;right:3.7cqw;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:3cqw\">\n<div style=\"font-size:1.3cqw;letter-spacing:.3em;font-weight:800;color:#7cdbed\">TWILITE <span style=\"color:#aab9d0\">/ RELEASE STRATEGY</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.4cqw\"><span style=\"font-size:1.2cqw;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#99b0c8\">DECISION 001</span><span style=\"font-size:1.2cqw;padding:.5cqw 1.5cqw;border:1px solid #e1b36d;border-radius:99px;color:#ffd494;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:800\">OPEN</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;top:8cqw;left:3.7cqw;max-width:78cqw\"><div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:.27em;color:#8cccdc;font-weight:750;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.3cqw\">A choice worth making deliberately</div><div style=\"font-family:Georgia,Palatino,serif;font-size:5.6cqw;line-height:1.07;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:#f7f8ff\">When should <span style=\"color:#71dcf3\">Twilite</span> launch?</div><div style=\"font-size:1.7cqw;line-height:1.5;color:#b9cce0;margin-top:1.5cqw;max-width:58cqw\">Speed matters. So does trust. Explore the arguments, weigh the trade-offs, and make the call when the evidence is good enough.</div></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;top:9cqw;right:3.7cqw;width:18cqw;border:1px solid rgba(127,171,202,.36);background:rgba(7,20,38,.58);border-radius:1.3cqw;padding:1.5cqw 1.8cqw\"><div style=\"font-size:1.08cqw;color:#88a9c5;letter-spacing:.16em\">TARGET DATE</div><div style=\"font-size:2.25cqw;color:#f6e2ba;font-weight:750;margin:.65cqw 0\">26 NOV 2026</div><div style=\"font-size:1.1cqw;color:#9fb9c9\">First paying customer goal</div></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:3.7cqw;right:3.7cqw;bottom:4cqw;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:4cqw;border-top:1px solid rgba(137,177,205,.35);padding-top:1.8cqw\"><div><div style=\"font-size:1.12cqw;color:#80cbe1;letter-spacing:.2em;font-weight:800\">READ THE MAP</div><div style=\"font-size:1.45cqw;color:#b8cee1;margin-top:.7cqw\">Criteria above &nbsp;·&nbsp; Release options below &nbsp;·&nbsp; Green favors &nbsp;·&nbsp; Red cautions</div></div><div style=\"text-align:right\"><div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:2.4cqw;color:#f8f8fd\">The decision is yours.</div><div style=\"font-size:1.1cqw;color:#8ca6bf;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:.5cqw\">A LIVING DECISION GRAPH</div></div></div>\n</div>"
        },
        "memo": "The environment: the room the graph's work sits in. This poster teaches; delete it and the graph stands on plain graph paper."
      }
    },
