        "body": "Twilite has been under development for approximately sixteen months. Its graph-native architecture is established, and the editor, templates, and AI authoring workflow are functioning. The target is a first paying customer by Thanksgiving 2026. The challenge is deciding how much product readiness is enough before inviting customers.",
